WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.700
No signal. Every messenger is dead.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.900
Now what?

3
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:05.800
Don't worry — I know a way out.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.400
We set up a TorgLink server
on the local network

5
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.000
and install the clients
for PC or phone.

6
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:16.200
TorgLink can also work
over Bluetooth.
